      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_5e08db9a66dadaed85fb2359337d0d4e0b1d1937c2086afbddd02cf841a3106b"
      ],
      "text": "The tmux evaluation acknowledges a remaining gap: if Gunicorn kills a worker, PTY file descriptors are lost and the localStorage recovery approach cannot restore those sessions."
    },
