      ],
      "text": "The stack uses Flask, Flask-SocketIO, Gunicorn, xterm.js, Python PTY, uv, Databricks SDK, Databricks AI Gateway, and MLflow; requirements.lock is hash-pinned and auto-regenerated by CI."
    },
