        "slc_f79e33063c1b708cebf89bf9dc18074948b562551006f942676d9003919f727a"
      ],
      "text": "Claude Code sessions are traced to a Databricks MLflow experiment via a Stop hook calling mlflow.claude_code.hooks.stop_hook_handler(), configured at startup by setup_mlflow.py in ~/.claude/settings.json."
    },
