      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_ab793ec2babbcee42075cace9cd610272becbd85f6b9eebb1dce28668d78c400"
      ],
      "text": "Production Gunicorn is configured with workers=1 because PTY state is process-local, threads=16, gthread worker class, and a 60-second timeout for long-lived WebSocket connections."
    },
