  "summary": "A Databricks Apps template that runs five coding-agent CLIs (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Hermes Agent, OpenCode) in a browser terminal wired to a Databricks workspace, with bundled skills, MCP servers, MLflow tracing, and PAT-based auth; the project has moved to Databricks Labs. Evidence coverage: 143 of 177 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
  "superseded_claim_ids": []
}
